head EAA5
|N115: tank vapour shut-off valve (chip reg. $19 bit 2).
|Enabled 50 calls (5 s) after sync (C844).
|Switched on:  pressure above 102 (96 + 6, ≈0.8 bar abs. [assumed])  or
|              engine speed above threshold + 4.
|Switched off: at idle, or pressure below 96 and engine speed below threshold.
|Engine speed threshold (C840…C843): 48 units (≈1070 rpm) if the G42 snapshot is ≥ 128
|(cold air), otherwise 58 units (≈1290 rpm). Same for AT and HS.
