head F760
|Factory patch: two more G71 checks (bit 1 in $8091).
|1) Full throttle (F81), engine speed not below C846 = 80 units (≈1780 rpm),
|   and pressure differs from atmospheric by less than 13 for 30 calls
|   in a row (3 s, C848): bit 1.
|2) Pump enabled, N75 active ($8067/$8068 not zero), engine speed ≥ 80 units,
|   and pressure dropped by 25 or more within 100 ms (C847; $806D is the pressure on
|   the previous call): remember it ($806E.0). If the pressure then stays for 6 calls
|   in a row (C849) near atmospheric: bit 1. Looks like a detached
|   boost hose [assumed].
