|2) PORT2.5 [?] = 1 at engine speed ≥ 20 units (≈440-480 rpm), only after synchronisation.
|3) Polling of the chip's ADC: channels 0-5 -> $8019-$801E, 7 -> $8020. Channel 6 (knock)
|   is not read here. Channel 4 ($801D) is read once — on the first tick after
|   synchronisation ($8075.0).
