|Open-circuit and short-circuit check of the temperature sensors. Flags in $8092:
|bit 7 — G42 faulty now; 5 — G42 below 16 (short circuit); 4 — G42 above 235 (open circuit);
|bit 6 — G62 faulty now; 3 — G62 below 8 (short circuit); 2 — G62 above 228 (open circuit).
