|Factory patch: timing retard on a rapid pressure rise with a warm engine
|(G62 ≤ 63, throttle not closed, mode E0B8 not active). Pressure rise over 40 ms
|($8073) on axis F7E0 = 0 4 11 15 30 43 56 68 -> F7E8 = 0 0 0 6 6 6 6 6:
|a rise of 15 or more gives a retard of 6 units. The largest is stored ($8213), then
|the retard $8211 = (25 - n) × 10 × $8213 / 256 decays over 25 calls (0.5 s).
