head FA00
|Factory patch: $8214 is the multiplier for lambda jumps and steps (/256).
|With rpm below C84A = 120 units and pressure below C84B = 140 it is 255 (full steps);
|otherwise it decreases by 5 (C84D) per call down to 64 (C84C), so steps are 4 times smaller
|at high rpm and load.
