CAD3 repeat
CAD5 checksum correct?
CAD7 no
CAD9 start
CADA patterns $55 and $AA
CADD write $55
CADF read back?
CAE1 no - RAM faulty
CAE3 write $AA
CAE5 read back?
CAE7 no - RAM faulty
CAE9 clear
CAEB next
CAEC up to $8290
CAEF repeat
CAF1 restore codes from the copy
CAF3 (same)
CAF6 (same)
CAF8 (same)
