F665 register $00
F667 select
F66A read
F66D - 94
F66F not below zero
F671 absolute value
F672 $80F4
F675 exit
label F676 ICF
head F676
|ICF - capture on P20 (input Tin): REFERENCE MARK G4 (once per crankshaft revolution) [assumed from logic].
|$8095.4 - a mark occurred (for the "540 teeth without a mark" check, D352).
|The first 3 marks check G4 ($8095.0). After that, not during start, the Hall signal must
|change from mark to mark (phase $8095.2): 2 times high at the wrong moment gives 2113
|($8094 bits 3, 2), 3 times low at the wrong moment gives 2113 (bits 1, 0).
|A mark without teeth between marks ($8095.3 not set) 2 times gives 2111 G28 ($8094 bits 7, 6).
F676 X = $8000
F679 mark occurred ($8095.4)
F67C G4 already checked?
F67F yes
F681 "teeth already occurred"
F684 exit the actuator test
F687 mark counter
F689 already 2?
F68B yes - G4 checked
F68D + 1
F68E store
F690 exit
F692 G4 checked ($8095.0)
F695 0
F696 store
F698 start?
F69B yes - do not check Hall
F69D Hall high?
F6A0 no
F6A2 expected low (phase)?
F6A5 no - phase correct
F6A7 mismatch counter
F6A9 + 1
F6AA store
F6AC below 2?
F6AE yes
F6B0 Hall fault (2113)
F6B3 continue
F6B5 clear suspicion
F6B8 1
F6BA store
F6BC phase: next is low
F6BF continue
F6C1 expected high?
F6C4 no - phase correct
F6C6 mismatch counter
F6C8 + 1
F6C9 store
F6CB below 3?
F6CD yes
F6CF Hall fault (2113)
F6D2 continue
F6D4 clear suspicion
F6D7 1
F6D9 store
F6DB phase: next is high
F6DE teeth between marks occurred ($8095.3)?
F6E1 no
F6E3 clear G28 suspicion
F6E6 clear "teeth occurred"
F6E9 counter = 0
F6EB marks without teeth
F6ED + 1
F6EE below 2?
F6F0 yes
F6F2 G28 fault (2111)
F6F5 0
F6F6 store
F6F8 clear the capture flag
F6FA (read ICR)
F6FC exit
label F6FD SCI
head F6FD
|SCI - K-line receive interrupt [?]. If it is time to transmit ($80F7.6), clear it;
|otherwise, if the sync bytes have been sent and no byte is waiting yet, mark it ($80F6.4).
|Then disable this interrupt and discard the received byte (its own echo on
|the single-wire K-line [assumed]). Main reception is by polling in task 0.
F6FD byte received?
F700 no
F702 communication flags
F705 time to transmit?
F707 yes
F709 session state
F70C sync bytes not sent - discard
F70E byte already waiting?
F710 yes - exit
F712 mark
F714 store
F717 continue
F719 clear "time to transmit"
F71B store
F71E disable the receive interrupt
F721 read the status
F723 discard the byte
F725 exit
