F736 timer
F738 test step
F73A N17 counters
F73C phase timer, test divider
F73E contact 5 closed time
F740 restore X
F741 return
table F742 14 empty (FF)
head F750
|Patch to E56D: +5 % to N7 at full load with prolonged knock ($807A.5)
|or with a knock sensor fault ($80B6 bits 7, 5).
